; Split-horizon zone for ruby.peetvandesande.com.
;
; Publicly a CNAME to ruby's OVH hostname (vps-5ca50660.vps.ovh.net,
; 145.239.73.18). nginx there admits its admin pages - postfixadmin, rspamd,
; webchat, reports - only from home and VPN ranges, and a LAN client that
; resolves the public name arrives over the internet from Orange's IPv6 prefix
; and is refused. Pointing it at ruby's tunnel addresses sends it over
; wgclient1 instead, from its 192.168.8.x or fd33:5692:1834:1000::/64 address.
;
; It stays on ruby's dummy0 addresses - nginx listens on all of them, and
; unlike mail this name needs nothing that is bound to wg0 only. Both are
; reachable from the LAN over wgclient1: 192.168.254.254 via dst_net4399 and
; the router's 19000 rules, and fd33:5692:1834:254::254 via the 19000 rules
; and table 1001's route6 entries - see router/README.md. The AAAA was left
; out until 2026-10-16, because the v6 address did not answer from the LAN
; before the 19000 rules went in on 2026-10-11.
;
; The zone is deliberately the SINGLE NAME, not peetvandesande.com, and needs a
; matching addNTA() on Delphi or every lookup here SERVFAILs.
;
; GENERATED by dns/ansible - do not edit this file by hand.
; The source is dns/ansible/group_vars/all.yml. Change it there and run
;   cd dns/ansible && ansible-playbook zones.yml
; which rewrites this file, bumps the serial only if the contents changed,
; pushes it to Pythia and reloads just this zone.
$TTL 3600
$ORIGIN ruby.peetvandesande.com.

@       IN  SOA pythia.home. hostmaster.home. (
                2026102301  ; serial
                3600        ; refresh
                900         ; retry
                604800      ; expire
                3600 )      ; negative TTL

@       IN  NS      pythia.home.

@       IN  A       192.168.254.254          ; ruby, over wgclient1
@       IN  AAAA    fd33:5692:1834:254::254  ; ruby's dummy0, over wgclient1
